Apple will introduce new <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/macbook-ultra/">OLED</a> touchscreen <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/macbook-pro/">MacBook Pro</a> models and an &zwnj;OLED&zwnj; <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ipad-mini/">iPad mini</a> "on or around" Tuesday, October 27, reports <em><a href="https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-08/apple-set-to-debut-touch-screen-macbook-and-new-ipad-mini-in-late-october">Bloomberg</a></em>. The launch will also include an M6 14-inch &zwnj;MacBook Pro&zwnj; and an M6 <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/imac/">iMac</a>.<br/>
